exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0625.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0622","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0622.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0836","title":"CamShot WebCam Trial 2.6 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CamShot WebCam 2.6 Trial 版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 WebCam 服务发送超长 Authorization 头部触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 CamShot WebCam 2.6 Trial 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码（EDB-ID: 20224），攻击者可借此完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0836"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.097","remediation":"立即卸载 CamShot WebCam Trial 2.6 试用版，该版本已不再受支持且存在远程代码执行漏洞。建议迁移至现代 WebCam 服务器软件（如 Yawcam、iSpy 等），并在防火墙层面限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问 WebCam 服务端口（默认 80），同时禁用 Basic 认证或改用更安全的认证方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0176.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1685","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5246","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20224","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0836.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0836","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0836.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0836.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m45p-gjgq-5g92/GHSA-m45p-gjgq-5g92.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0836.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--edf2618a-76d1-4b34-915d-cd1cec66e0e5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0622.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0622.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0622.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0620","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0620.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0835","title":"Sambar Server Search CGI 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.3 及 4.4 Beta 3 版本中的 search.dll ISAPI Search 功能存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 query 参数传入恶意构造的目录路径，利用 Search CGI 组件读取服务器上的任意目录内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC 利用代码，攻击者可据此实施信息收集攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0835"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.977","remediation":"Sambar Server 已停止维护多年，官方不再发布安全更新。建议立即迁移至现代 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 IIS），并移除 search.dll ISAPI 扩展。如短期内无法迁移，可在 IIS 管理器中删除 search.dll 的脚本映射，或通过 URL 重写规则拦截对 /search.dll 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0175.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1684","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0835","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0835.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-23ww-2jh7-98f9/GHSA-23ww-2jh7-98f9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0620.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0618","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0618.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0834","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet 客户端 NTLM 身份认证漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 系统自带的 telnet 客户端默认会尝试进行 NTLM 身份认证，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 telnet:// URL 并诱导目标用户访问，当用户点击该链接后，telnet 客户端会自动向攻击者控制的恶意服务器发送 NTLM 挑战/响应数据包，攻击者即可捕获并重放这些凭据信息，从而获取用户的 NTLM 哈希值，进而实现身份冒充或进一步渗透。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 所有版本，无需额外权限即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0834"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.847","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-067 提供的官方补丁，下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=0D0032E7-259D-4F68-BF08-B0A7CAA1FD1C。如无法打补丁，可在命令提示符下运行 telnet 后执行 `unset ntlm` 禁用 NTLM 默认认证；同时将 Internet Explorer 安全区域中\"Local intranet\"和\"Trusted sites\"的自动登录设置为禁用，并在边界防火墙阻断入站远程登录服务（如 TCP 139/445/23/3389）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a091400-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1683","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-067","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5242","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20222","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0834.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0834.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0834","https://github.com/ycdxsb/WindowsPrivilegeEscalation/blob/83cfb90bc21df6131575036ab16263503e09daf2/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4m4v-vqhc-mhjp/GHSA-4m4v-vqhc-mhjp.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-067.nasl","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d7890aa55fe08c54e4bb2c6a32cb2e550dcd1668/2000/CVE-2000-0834.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2008-4037/README_EN.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-4037.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0618.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0616","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0616.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0833","title":"Jack De Winter WinSMTP 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"WinSMTP 1.06f 及 2.X 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 SMTP 服务发送超长的 USER 或 HELO 命令触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Jack De Winter 开发的 WinSMTP 邮件服务器软件，CVSS v2 评分 10.0，攻击复杂度低，可造成机密性、完整性和可用性的完全丧失。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码（EDB-ID: 20221）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0833"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.727","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 WinSMTP 1.06f 及 2.x 版本，迁移至仍受支持的 SMTP 服务器软件（如 hMailServer、MailEnable 等）。若无法立即迁移，在防火墙层面限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 TCP 端口 25，并对 SMTP 服务实施输入长度限制以缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/81693","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1680","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5255","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20221","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0833","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0833.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5rg3-r5cf-mhqx/GHSA-5rg3-r5cf-mhqx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob